# E §6.3: "A day no statement covers has no observations to compare, so it prints no line; an instance dated there
# that an observation fulfils is compared all the same, its matched line on the instance's day" (January: konto is
# covered by no version, bank_rows[r1] fulfils wage[2026-01] a day late: matched, timing +1 days); and unexplained:
# "an observation ... whose instance ... the model at K doesn't hold (one that only a version known after K makes: the
# forecast didn't expect it)": extra[2026-02] exists only from extra_feb (known 2026-02-01), so at the cut 2026-01-15
# (back) bank_rows[r3], which fulfils it, is unexplained; at `on` (led) it is matched. The layout is this
# interpreter's.
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
source bank "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input bank_rows: observed
input wage_amt: money PLN
input wage_dom: int
input extra_on[m in months]: bool
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move wage[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, wage_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount wage_amt

move extra[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, wage_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  when extra_on[m]
  leg cash from world to konto amount wage_amt

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  wage_amt = 1 000.00 PLN "umowa"
  wage_dom = 10 "umowa"
  extra_on = false "umowa"
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

version extra_feb
  cite plan
  governs 2026-02
  known 2026-02-01
  extra_on[2026-02] = true "aneks"

version bank_jan
  cite bank
  governs 2026-01
  known 2026-02-02
  bank_rows[r1] = (on: 2026-01-11, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 1 000.00 PLN, fulfils: wage[2026-01]) "line 1"

version bank_feb
  cite bank
  governs 2026-02
  known 2026-03-02
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  bank_rows[r2] = (on: 2026-02-10, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 1 000.00 PLN, fulfils: wage[2026-02]) "line 2"
  bank_rows[r3] = (on: 2026-02-10, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 1 000.00 PLN, fulfils: extra[2026-02]) "line 3"

ask led: residuals konto 2026-01..2026-02
ask back: residuals konto 2026-01..2026-02 as known 2026-01-15
=== expect
back: residuals konto 2026-01 .. 2026-02
  2026-02 unexplained: model 0.00 PLN, observed 1 000.00 PLN, difference 1 000.00 PLN
    unexplained bank_rows[r3] on 2026-02-10: observed 1 000.00 PLN
  2026-01 move wage: model 1 000.00 PLN, observed 1 000.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched wage[2026-01] on 2026-01-10: model 1 000.00 PLN, observed 1 000.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +1 days
  2026-02 move wage: model 1 000.00 PLN, observed 1 000.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched wage[2026-02] on 2026-02-10: model 1 000.00 PLN, observed 1 000.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-01-15
led: residuals konto 2026-01 .. 2026-02
  2026-01 move wage: model 1 000.00 PLN, observed 1 000.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched wage[2026-01] on 2026-01-10: model 1 000.00 PLN, observed 1 000.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +1 days
  2026-02 move extra: model 1 000.00 PLN, observed 1 000.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched extra[2026-02] on 2026-02-10: model 1 000.00 PLN, observed 1 000.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  2026-02 move wage: model 1 000.00 PLN, observed 1 000.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched wage[2026-02] on 2026-02-10: model 1 000.00 PLN, observed 1 000.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-10-20
